      "value": {
        "markup": "<p>We fill into soft oak and leave it by the sea. The warehouses stand close enough to the water that the air works on the casks all year: the spirit comes out floral and gentle, with the salt that only a coastal maturation gives.</p><p>Three bottlings, a small still house, and an open door most of the year.</p>",
        "blocks": null
      }
    },
